              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Debezium is a set of distributed services to capture changes in your databases so that your applications can see those changes and respond to them. Debezium records all row-level changes within each database table in a "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "change event stream"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", and applications simply read these streams to see the change events in the same order in which they occurred."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
